    </rdf:Bag>
   </dc:subject>
   <dc:rights>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">FAO. Editorial use only. Photo credit must be given.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:rights>
   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">29 June 2011, Kilobelobe - Men transporting sacks of cabbage to market by bicycle. As part of its urban and peri-urban horticulture project, FAO has provided farmers with improved-variety seeds and has rehabilitated irrigation and flood-prevention infrastructures.&#xA;FAO Project GCP /GLO/258/EC: EU Food Facility programme monitoring and visibility - Batch 1 (209/557), BKF (210/508) and ERI (215/181) - EU Food Facility programme monitoring and visibility.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
