   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">24 April 2013, Gaza City, West Bank and Gaza Strip - A beneficiary of the FAO Project tending to the vegetable garden he maintains on the rooftop of his home.&#xA;FAO Project: OSRO/GAZ/109/BEL - Rapid mitigation of the livelihood crisis in the Gaza Strip. The overall objective of promoting higher economic access to food in the Gaza Strip, is realized through improving household-level food production (aquaculture and rooftop garden units) and reinforcing operational coordination and evidence-based, food security-related information management.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
